# The over-the-air update signing key (#579). It lives outside the repository
# and in the release workflow's EXPO_UPDATES_PRIVATE_KEY secret, never here; the
# public certificate is apps/mobile/certs/certificate.pem. These are where
# `expo-updates codesigning:generate` and `eas update` would put or look for it.
apps/mobile/keys/
apps/mobile/certs/private-key.pem
apps/mobile/certs/public-key.pem
*private-key*.pem
*.private.pem
